\begin{lemma}[CM polynomial algebra]
\label{algebra-lemma-CM-polynomial-algebra}
\source{stacks:00ND}
\href{https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/00ND}{\texttt{Stacks tag 00ND}}
\group{algebra}

Suppose $R$ is a Noetherian Cohen-Macaulay ring.
Any polynomial algebra over $R$ is Cohen-Macaulay.
