see Definition \ref{algebra-definition-going-up-down}. If
$\mathfrak q \subset S$ is a maximal ideal.
Then the inverse image of $\mathfrak q$ in $R$
is a maximal ideal too.
\end{lemma}

\begin{proof}
Trivial.
\end{proof}

